{"root":"hebat","ipa":"/həbat/","core":"形容词。指某人或某事非常出色、卓越、强大、令人印象深刻或规模宏大。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/həbat/","zh":"极好的，卓越的，强大的","phrases":[{"t":"hebat sekali","zh":"非常棒"},{"t":"usaha yang hebat","zh":"伟大的事业"},{"t":"bukan main hebat","zh":"了不起，非同凡响"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia adalah pemain sepak bola yang hebat.","zh":"他是一位出色的足球运动员。"},{"t":"Perubahan cuaca ini sungguh hebat.","zh":"这次天气变化非常剧烈。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"hebat","ipa":"/həbat/","zh":"极好的，卓越的","phrase":{"t":"hebat benar","zh":"确实很棒"},"example":{"t":"Ide kamu hebat.","zh":"你的主意很棒。"}},{"w":"kehebatan","ipa":"/kəhəbatan/","zh":"卓越，伟大，威力","phrase":{"t":"kehebatan seseorang","zh":"某人的卓越之处"},"example":{"t":"Semua orang mengakui kehebatan atlet itu.","zh":"所有人都承认那位运动员的卓越能力。"}},{"w":"menghebat","ipa":"/məŋhəbat/","zh":"变得更强，加剧","phrase":{"t":"persaingan menghebat","zh":"竞争加剧"},"example":{"t":"Badai itu mulai menghebat di malam hari.","zh":"暴风雨在夜间开始加剧。"}},{"w":"menghebatkan","ipa":"/məŋhəbatkan/","zh":"使……变得卓越，加强","phrase":{"t":"menghebatkan prestasi","zh":"提升成就"},"example":{"t":"Latihan keras dapat menghebatkan kemampuan kita.","zh":"刻苦训练可以增强我们的能力。"}}],"derSlugs":["hebat","kehebatan","menghebat","menghebatkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-25T09:34:56.270Z","src":"base"}